#: ../../dev/building.md:1
msgid "Building"
msgstr "ビルド"

#: ../../dev/building.md:3
msgid ""
"All builds are driven through the `Makefile`. Run targets from the "
"`sphinx-docs/` directory."
msgstr ""
"すべてのビルドは `Makefile` 経由で実行します。ターゲットは `sphinx-docs/` ディレクトリで実行してください。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:5
msgid "Build commands"
msgstr "ビルドコマンド"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Command"
msgstr "コマンド"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "説明"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make install`"
msgstr "`make install`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Install Python dependencies via `uv sync`."
msgstr "`uv sync` で Python 依存をインストールします。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make html`"
msgstr "`make html`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Build the English site → `_build/html/`."
msgstr "英語サイトをビルド → `_build/html/`。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make build-ja`"
msgstr "`make build-ja`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Build the Japanese site (uses `-D language=ja`) → `_build/html_ja/`."
msgstr "日本語サイトをビルド（`-D language=ja` 指定）→ `_build/html_ja/`。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make build-all`"
msgstr "`make build-all`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Build EN + JA, assemble into `_build/site/{en,ja}/`, and run Pagefind."
msgstr "EN + JA をビルドして `_build/site/{en,ja}/` に統合し、Pagefind を実行します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make gettext`"
msgstr "`make gettext`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Extract translatable strings into `_build/gettext/*.pot`."
msgstr "翻訳対象文字列を `_build/gettext/*.pot` に抽出します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make update-po`"
msgstr "`make update-po`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid ""
"Run `gettext`, then `sphinx-intl update -p _build/gettext -l ja`. Updates"
" `.po` files in `locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/`."
msgstr ""
"`gettext` を実行した後、`sphinx-intl update -p _build/gettext -l ja` を実行します。"
"`locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/` 配下の `.po` ファイルを更新します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make serve`"
msgstr "`make serve`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid ""
"Build EN + JA + assemble + Pagefind, then serve `_build/site/` at "
"`http://localhost:8000`."
msgstr ""
"EN + JA + assemble + Pagefind を実行し、`_build/site/` を `http://localhost:8000` で配信します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make liveserve`"
msgstr "`make liveserve`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Run `sphinx-autobuild` for the English site only (auto-rebuild on save)."
msgstr "英語サイトのみで `sphinx-autobuild` を実行します（保存時に自動リビルド）。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make linkcheck`"
msgstr "`make linkcheck`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Validate all links → `_build/linkcheck/`."
msgstr "全リンクを検証 → `_build/linkcheck/`。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make pagefind`"
msgstr "`make pagefind`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Build the Pagefind search index for an existing `_build/site/`."
msgstr "既存の `_build/site/` に対し Pagefind 検索インデックスを生成します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make lint`"
msgstr "`make lint`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Run `ruff check` and `ruff format --check`."
msgstr "`ruff check` と `ruff format --check` を実行します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make test`"
msgstr "`make test`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Run `pytest`."
msgstr "`pytest` を実行します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make check`"
msgstr "`make check`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`lint` + `test`."
msgstr "`lint` + `test`。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make clean`"
msgstr "`make clean`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Remove `_build/`."
msgstr "`_build/` を削除します。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:24
msgid "Output"
msgstr "出力"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Path"
msgstr "パス"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`_build/html/`"
msgstr "`_build/html/`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid ""
"English HTML (the default `make html` output, also used as the Pages-"
"default `/en/`)."
msgstr ""
"英語 HTML（`make html` のデフォルト出力。Pages デフォルトの `/en/` にも使用）。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`_build/html_ja/`"
msgstr "`_build/html_ja/`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Japanese HTML."
msgstr "日本語 HTML。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`_build/site/`"
msgstr "`_build/site/`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid ""
"Assembled bilingual site with `/en/`, `/ja/`, root `index.html` "
"(redirects to `/en/`), and Pagefind index."
msgstr ""
"`/en/` / `/ja/` / ルート `index.html`（`/en/` にリダイレクト）/ Pagefind インデックスを含む統合済みバイリンガルサイト。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`_build/gettext/`"
msgstr "`_build/gettext/`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`.pot` files extracted by `make gettext`."
msgstr "`make gettext` で抽出された `.pot` ファイル。"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`_build/linkcheck/`"
msgstr "`_build/linkcheck/`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`make linkcheck` results."
msgstr "`make linkcheck` の結果。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:34
msgid "i18n round-trip"
msgstr "i18n ラウンドトリップ"

#: ../../dev/building.md:36
msgid "Whenever an English `.md` source changes, the round-trip is:"
msgstr "英語 `.md` ソースが変更されたら、次のラウンドトリップを実行します:"

#: ../../dev/building.md:45
msgid ""
"Empty `msgstr` entries in `.po` cause Sphinx to fall back to the English "
"source string for that paragraph in the Japanese build, which is "
"acceptable as a temporary state but should be filled in before release."
msgstr ""
"`.po` 内で `msgstr` が空のエントリは、日本語ビルド時に Sphinx が英語ソース文字列に"
"フォールバックします。一時的な状態としては許容されますが、リリース前には埋めるべきです。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:47
msgid "CI Pipeline"
msgstr "CI パイプライン"

#: ../../dev/building.md:49
msgid ""
"The active workflow is "
"[`.github/workflows/docs.yml`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/.github/workflows/docs.yml). It triggers on push and PR "
"for changes under `sphinx-docs/**` and on manual dispatch."
msgstr ""
"アクティブなワークフローは [`.github/workflows/docs.yml`]"
"(https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-tauri/blob/main/.github/workflows"
"/docs.yml) です。`sphinx-docs/**` 配下の変更に対する push / PR と手動 dispatch で起動します。"

