#: ../../dev/building.md:59
msgid ""
"The status of every workflow file (active / opt-in template / planned for"
" Phase 1) is documented in "
"[`.github/workflows/README.md`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/.github/workflows/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"全ワークフローファイルの状態（active / opt-in template / Phase 1 で予定）は "
"[`.github/workflows/README.md`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/.github/workflows/README.md) に記載されています。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:62
msgid ""
"GitHub Pages deployment is currently inactive because the repository is "
"private (see the README \"Visibility\" block). Pages will be enabled at "
"the Phase 1 release together with the visibility switch."
msgstr ""
"リポジトリが private のため GitHub Pages デプロイは現在停止中です（README の "
"\"Visibility\" ブロック参照）。Pages は Phase 1 リリース時の visibility 切替と"
"同時に有効化されます。"
